entityDescription:
a) the development, marketing and sales, design and supply of systems and components for nuclear power plants with pressurized water reactors and boiling water reactors or systems and components for nuclear power plants with all types of reactors, both for the nuclear and conventional parts of such plants;
(b) the development, marketing and sales, the provision of engineering services and other Consulting services and the provision of service and maintenance work for nuclear power plants of all types reactors, including the supply of equipment required for this purpose, both for the dismantling of nuclear facilities and for the treatment of nuclear waste, in particular for handling, storage and Spent fuel conditioning; 
c) the development, marketing and sales, design, production and supply of fuel assemblies for all types of reactors, including related engineering services, and other consultancy services, the procurement of nuclear fuels and the supply of equipment for the production of fuelassemblies;
(d) the development, marketing and distribution, design and delivery of systems and components for fusion and research reactors, both for nuclear and nuclear reactors. conventional part of such facilities; 
e) the development, marketing and sales, as well as the provision of engineering services and other consulting services and the provision of services and maintenance work in the field of industrial and energy technology; 
(f) the conclusion of licence agreements with regard to of the above-mentioned fields of work.

